//!
//! Bivvy is a CLI tool that replaces ad-hoc `bin/setup` scripts with
//! declarative YAML configuration and a polished interactive CLI experience.
//!
//! # Modules
//!
//! - [`cli`] - Command-line interface and argument parsing
